1
00:00:00,417 --> 00:00:04,004
[The last day of
"Love Mate" shooting]

2
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:17,596
It's been a while

3
00:00:17,679 --> 00:00:19,353
since I had fun
at an amusement park

4
00:00:19,478 --> 00:00:20,478
Same for me

5
00:00:21,813 --> 00:00:23,133
Don't you have
good news to share?

6
00:00:25,484 --> 00:00:26,484
What do you mean?

7
00:00:28,987 --> 00:00:30,989
You passed
the audition

8
00:00:31,114 --> 00:00:32,114
Oh, right

9
00:00:32,991 --> 00:00:34,117
How did you know that?

10
00:00:34,243 --> 00:00:35,744
I know it because
I'm your boyfriend

11
00:00:35,869 --> 00:00:36,869
Congratulations

12
00:00:37,704 --> 00:00:38,872
Thank you

13
00:00:38,997 --> 00:00:41,917
At least you should've
called me first

14
00:00:42,042 --> 00:00:43,794
I was the one who
helped you with that

15
00:00:43,919 --> 00:00:44,919
I'm a little upset

16
00:00:47,047 --> 00:00:49,299
Could you get a little
closer to each other?

17
00:00:49,424 --> 00:00:50,467
-In a romantic vibe
-Okay

18
00:01:09,569 --> 00:01:11,655
Could you show
more affection

19
00:01:11,780 --> 00:01:14,908
recalling what you've
done so far?

20
00:01:15,033 --> 00:01:17,035
More affection? Got it

21
00:01:17,160 --> 00:01:19,162
Okay, we'll start
shooting again

22
00:01:19,288 --> 00:01:20,288
Okay

23
00:01:25,043 --> 00:01:26,043
What's up?

24
00:01:26,086 --> 00:01:27,254
Are you feeling unwell?

25
00:01:27,379 --> 00:01:28,880
No, don't worry about it
